Package: jatosr
Title: Download and Manage 'JATOS' Study Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Gidon T.", "Frischkorn", , "gfrischkorn@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5055-9764"))
Description: A client for the REST API of 'JATOS' (Just Another Tool for
    Online Studies, <https://www.jatos.org>). API tokens are kept in the
    credential store of the operating system through the 'keyring' package,
    and read from environment variables where a platform supplies them, so
    that they never appear in scripts. Functions list studies, batches and
    components, retrieve result metadata, download result data and uploaded
    files incrementally into a local cache, import a results archive, read
    'jsPsych' JSON result files into one data frame with the run's metadata
    joined, save it as rds, csv, tsv, parquet or RData together with a
    provenance record, and generate study codes. The 'JATOS' retrieval
    workflow is modelled on the 'smartr' package by Chenyu Li.
